text:
(Translated by Google) Simply magnificent;
very tasty food, excellent service, good prices, all very hygienic and quick service. CONGRATULATIONS!!!!

(Original)
Simplemente magnifico;
muy sabrosa comida, exelente atención, buenos precios, todo muy higienico y rapida atención. FELICITACIONES!!!!

Out of 3 visits, they messed up one.
Otherwise good in-n-out location!
@managers,if your food cost, specially packet sauces are up, image is the reason, I specifically asked for 2 packets of ketchup and one spread that's what I got!
